# Corre primeiro auth-service/auth.http (guarda aliceToken e bobToken)

### Criar loja sem token -> 401
POST http://localhost:8082/stores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard Shop",
  "email": "hello@keyboardshop.com"
}

### A alice cria uma loja e fica como dona (guarda o id em storeId)
POST http://localhost:8082/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard Shop",
  "email": "hello@keyboardshop.com"
}

> {% client.global.set("storeId", response.body.id); %}

### Listar todas (público)
GET http://localhost:8082/stores

### Obter por id (público)
GET http://localhost:8082/stores/{{storeId}}

### Lojas da alice
GET http://localhost:8082/stores/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### Lojas do bob -> lista vazia
GET http://localhost:8082/stores/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### A alice atualiza a loja (PUT substitui os dados da loja)
PUT http://localhost:8082/stores/{{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard Shop Lisboa",
  "email": "lisboa@keyboardshop.com"
}

### O bob tenta atualizar a loja da alice -> 403
PUT http://localhost:8082/stores/{{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hijacked",
  "email": "bob@kafkalab.dev"
}

### O bob tenta desativar a loja da alice -> 403
DELETE http://localhost:8082/stores/{{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### Validação: nome vazio e email inválido -> 400
POST http://localhost:8082/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email"
}

### Id que não existe -> 404 (ProblemDetail)
GET http://localhost:8082/stores/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### A alice desativa a loja (soft delete) -> 204; o product-service desativa os produtos desta loja
DELETE http://localhost:8082/stores/{{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### Depois de desativar: status INACTIVE
GET http://localhost:8082/stores/{{storeId}}

### Editar uma loja inativa -> 409
PUT http://localhost:8082/stores/{{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard Shop",
  "email": "hello@keyboardshop.com"
}

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health
